    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Survive in Ankara!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSurvive in Ankara is a time-based survival game featuring minimalistic gameplay and roguelite elements. In a world where hell is empty and devils roam free, there's nowhere to run or hide. Your only goal is to survive as long as possible until death inevitably claims you. Collect gold during each run to purchase upgrades and aid future survivors.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCompatible with mouse, keyboard, controller, and touch screen.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n5 Different Maps + 5 customized characters",
